r.paid",", ",[210,302,303],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[210,306,307],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[215,310,217],{"href":311},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[231,314,315,320,325],{},[249,316,317],{},[210,318,319],{},"reason",[249,321,322],{},[210,323,324],{},"string | null",[249,326,327,328,331,332,335,336,300,339,304,342,345],{},"Why the event fired, for events with more than one cause. Always present; ",[210,329,330],{},"null"," for every event except ",[210,333,334],{},"subscription.updated",", where it is ",[210,337,338],{},"updated_immediately",[210,340,341],{},"updated_on_renewal",[210,343,344],{},"renewed",". New values may be added over time.",[231,347,348,353,357],{},[249,349,350],{},[210,351,352],{},"entityType",[249,354,355],{},[210,356,258],{},[249,358,359,360,300,363,300,366,300,369,300,372,304,375,218],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[210,361,362],{},"order",[210,364,365],{},"refund",[210,367,368],{},"subscription",[210,370,371],{},"checkout",[210,373,374],{},"one_off_product",[210,376,377],{},"subscription_plan",[231,379,380,385,389],{},[249,381,382],{},[210,383,384],{},"entityId",[249,386,387],{},[210,388,258],{},[249,390,391],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[231,393,394,399,403],{},[249,395,396],{},[210,397,398],{},"object",[249,400,401],{},[210,402,398],{},[249,404,405,406,408,409,412,413,415,416,419,420,218],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[210,407,272],{}," field. Note ",[210,410,411],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[210,414,352],{},": chargeback events carry ",[210,417,418],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[210,421,398],{},[231,423,424,429,433],{},[249,425,426],{},[210,427,428],{},"createdAt",[249,430,431],{},[210,432,258],{},[249,434,435],{},"When the event occurred (ISO 8601 format).",[231,437,438,4